  "description": "Summer Operating Area: West Mediterranean - Riviera, Corsica, Sardinia\nWinter Operating Area: Based in Monaco with a berth and operating in the South of France, Corsica and Sardinia.\n\nStep aboard L’AS BLEU, the Riva 82’ Diva, the newest icon of Italian style - and available for charter for the very first time!\nHer innovative beach club with 2 folding terraces brings you closer to the sea, while the huge flybridge is made for sunsoaked days, sunset dinners, and unforgettable moments with friends and family.\n\nInside, you’ll find chic, contemporary interiors and 4 stunning en-suite cabins for up to 8 guests.\n\nWith stabilizers for maximum comfort, a cruising speed of 27 knots, and a top speed of 30 knots, the Diva model delivers the ultimate Mediterranean adventure.\n\nL’AS BLEU available in the South of France, Corsica, Sardinia, and along the Italian Coast, this is your chance to experience the thrill, style, and glamour of a brand-new Riva.\n",
